  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Rural and Agriculture Markets Development programme for Northern Nigeria -Programme Advisory  is a component of Rural and Agriculture Markets Development programme for Northern Nigeria (PrOpCom Mai-karfi) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;99,757. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Trade policy and administrative management, Rural development, Agricultural policy and administrative management, Livestock, Environmental research.</narrative>
  </description>
